+"""Exp5569 causal memory policy tournament.
+
+Spec refs: REQ-LEARN-5569,
+SCENARIO-LEARN-5569-STREAM,
+SCENARIO-LEARN-5569-TOURNAMENT,
+SCENARIO-LEARN-5569-ROLLBACK,
